  "description": "The Nulane Pro's frame takes inspiration from our road, gravel and mountain bike series, combining the best of each into a versatile, capable and rugged whole. There's plenty of clearance for big, grippy and comfortable 50mm tyres – or 45mm if you run mudguards at the same time. There's an integrated seat clamp, compatibility with our Semi-Integrated Carrier 2.1, guard and kickstand mounts, and neat Internal Cable Routing. And the full carbon fork isn't just lightweight – it also helps reduce vibration from the road and features lowrider rack mounts. Wherever you're going, it's got everything that you need.",
